  "goodToKnow": "Promovieren means to do or complete a doctorate: in Physik promovieren, über ein Thema promovieren. It's a false friend: promoting a product is bewerben. Die Promotion is the doctorate, the thesis is die Doktorarbeit or Dissertation, and the supervisor is der Doktorvater or die Doktormutter. In 2011 defence minister Karl-Theodor zu Guttenberg lost his doctorate for plagiarism and resigned. Perfect: hat promoviert."
